IELTS.lesson({"test": 2, "part": 2, "title": "Test 2, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "hadi", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيك موضوعاً وأريدك أن تتحدّث عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّث سيكون لديك دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقوله. ويمكنك تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردت. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/8bde42f6b99def20.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعك.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.", "ar": "أريدك أن تصف مهارة تعلّمتها وكانت صعبة في البداية.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/e7404e5d2fbe06e1.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديك دقيقة واحدة. سأخبرك عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّر أن لديك دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلق إن أوقفتك. سأخبرك عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنك أن تبدأ الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'll talk about reading construction drawings properly, which sounds like nothing and took me about a year.", "ar": "سأتحدّث عن قراءة المخطّطات الإنشائية كما يجب، وهذا يبدو بلا أهمية لكنه استغرق مني نحو سنة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/ea0f78e2e4524ba4.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "This was my first year on site, in Homs, straight out of university. And the thing is, I could read a drawing.", "ar": "كانت تلك سنتي الأولى في الموقع، في حمص، بعد الجامعة مباشرة. والمسألة أنني كنت أستطيع قراءة المخطّط.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/6ecd36bb5238ef64.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'd done four years of it and I could tell you what every line meant. What I was not able to do was look at a set of drawings and see the building.", "ar": "كنت قد درسته أربع سنوات وكنت أستطيع أن أخبرك بمعنى كل خطّ. ما لم أكن قادراً عليه هو أن أنظر إلى مجموعة مخطّطات فأرى المبنى.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/183a59bcd8e62ace.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "How I learned it was a foreman called Abu Rami, who had no degree at all and could do it instantly.", "ar": "تعلّمته من معلّم اسمه أبو رامي، لم تكن لديه شهادة على الإطلاق وكان يفعل ذلك فوراً.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/31f84a6cc92fde8e.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He'd look at a sheet for about ten seconds and say, that won't work, the pipe has to come through there. And he was always right.", "ar": "كان ينظر إلى اللوحة نحو عشر ثوانٍ ويقول: هذا لن ينجح، يجب أن يمرّ الأنبوب من هناك. وكان محقّاً دائماً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/d01de40142ec7845.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I followed him around for two weeks asking him how he knew, and he could not explain it, which was no help to me at all.", "ar": "تبعته أسبوعين أسأله كيف يعرف، ولم يستطع أن يشرح ذلك، وهذا لم يساعدني في شيء.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/2a7ef010fbb7d992.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Why it was hard, I think, is because nobody teaches it. They teach you the symbols.", "ar": "سبب صعوبته، على ما أعتقد، هو أن لا أحد يعلّمه. يعلّمونك الرموز.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/a9de62ecc7a6834e.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Nobody teaches you to hold four sheets in your head at once and notice that the electrical drawing and the structural drawing disagree. That's not a skill you can be told.", "ar": "لا أحد يعلّمك أن تحمل أربع لوحات في ذهنك في الوقت نفسه وتلاحظ أن المخطّط الكهربائي والمخطّط الإنشائي لا يتّفقان. هذه ليست مهارة يمكن أن تُقال لك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/64464b26ba5ae18a.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "You have to get it wrong about thirty times, and I got it wrong about thirty times.", "ar": "عليك أن تخطئ فيها نحو ثلاثين مرة، وأنا أخطأت فيها نحو ثلاثين مرة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/a6745b8624e23e73.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Now I do what Abu Rami did, more or less. And I still can't explain it to the new ones either, which I suppose is fair.", "ar": "الآن أفعل ما كان يفعله أبو رامي، تقريباً. وما زلت أنا أيضاً لا أستطيع شرحه للجدد، وأظنّ أن هذا منصف.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/f884c701eccc5a80.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the skill was</li><li>when and where you learned it</li><li>how you learned it</li><li>and explain why it was difficult at first</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Do you teach that skill to younger engineers now?", "ar": "شكراً لك. هل تعلّم تلك المهارة للمهندسين الأصغر الآن؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/66f3f9c609bc4de2.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Honestly, I try. Mostly I'll just put them in front of a problem on the Homs site and let them find it, because that's the only way it went in for me.", "ar": "بصراحة، أحاول. في الغالب أضعهم أمام مشكلة في موقع حمص وأتركهم يجدونها، لأن هذه الطريقة الوحيدة التي رسخت بها عندي.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/46d78195b024d6c0.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لك. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe a skill you learned that was difficult at first.", "bullets": ["what the skill was", "when and where you learned it", "how you learned it", "and explain why it was difficult at first"], "long": true, "model": "I'll talk about reading construction drawings properly, which sounds like nothing and took me about a year. This was my first year on site, in Homs, straight out of university. And the thing is, I could read a drawing. I'd done four years of it and I could tell you what every line meant. What I was not able to do was look at a set of drawings and see the building. How I learned it was a foreman called Abu Rami, who had no degree at all and could do it instantly. He'd look at a sheet for about ten seconds and say, that won't work, the pipe has to come through there. And he was always right. I followed him around for two weeks asking him how he knew, and he could not explain it, which was no help to me at all. Why it was hard, I think, is because nobody teaches it. They teach you the symbols. Nobody teaches you to hold four sheets in your head at once and notice that the electrical drawing and the structural drawing disagree. That's not a skill you can be told. You have to get it wrong about thirty times, and I got it wrong about thirty times. Now I do what Abu Rami did, more or less. And I still can't explain it to the new ones either, which I suppose is fair.", "why": "reading drawings first year, Homs site Abu Rami — 2 weeks not the lines — the THINKING"}, {"q": "Do you teach that skill to younger engineers now?", "model": "Honestly, I try. Mostly I'll just put them in front of a problem on the Homs site and let them find it, because that's the only way it went in for me.", "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120"}});
